# Ignore secrets
**/.secrets/**
**/*.secret
**/.certs/**
**/.certs-backup/**

# Include markdown documentation
!**/*.md

# Ignore podman directory mounts
**/volumes/**

# Credentials — never commit
talosconfig
kubeconfig
secrets.yaml
*.secret.yaml

# Rendered Talos machine configs (contain embedded secrets)
# Comment these out if you accept committing them to a PRIVATE repo
controlplane.yaml
controlplane-rpi-*.yaml
worker.yaml

# Large / regenerable artifacts
metal-arm64.raw
*.raw
